  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nA dice poker based strategic game of risk and reward!<p></p>\n<p><i>You have already lost. Fear not, Death is here for you.</i> I am afraid you have passed into the world beyond our own. Before you get there however, Death has offered to give you time to process your demise through means of some friendly competition.</p>\n<p><i>Balance risk and reward to bank as much damage as possible without going bust!</i> Engage in a game of Dice with the mysterious entity – collect new dice and their paired relics to warp your rolls into ever increasing layers of power and complexity. Bank your points to deal damage to your opponent, and pass before you push your luck too far or you’ll lose it all!</p>\n<p><i>Cheat Death with dozens of unique relics and their game breaking effects!</i> Unlock new classes and experiment with their core mechanics, unlock new relics and even dialogue paths with your mythical foe to influence the outcome!<br>\n</p>",
